te.\",\n              \"$ref\": \"functions.expression.Expression\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"title\": \"Value\",\n              \"description\": \"A literal value.\",\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"null\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"omitempty\": true\n    }\n  }\n}\n",
